{"id": "he0ffaa529a", "text": "Finland switched off every public government website. As a precaution.", "family": "bold-claim", "score": 10, "keys": ["ai", "as", "black", "break-in", "bugs", "confirmed", "critical", "early", "every", "far", "finland", "found", "government", "has", "internet", "itself", "leaked", "nobody", "october", "partly", "patched", "php", "php2shell", "precaution", "public", "successful", "switched", "website"], "from": "2026-10-25-black-october", "review": 17, "lane": "how-tech-works", "added": "2026-10-25", "used": []}
